    "summary": "ImageMagick is vulnerable to Heap Overflow when writing extremely large image profile in the PNG encoder",
    "details": "ImageMagick is free and open-source software used for editing and manipulating digital images. Prior to versions 7.1.2-16 and 6.9.13-41, an extremely large image profile could result in a heap overflow when encoding a PNG image. This vulnerability is fixed in 7.1.2-16 and 6.9.13-41.",
    "severity": [
